    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an intent classifier and data extractor for a battery sales chat.\n\nClassify the customer's reply into EXACTLY ONE of these 11 intents:\n\nORDER_CONFIRMATION, ORDER_CANCELLATION, NEGOTIATE_PRICE, ASK_WARRANTY, ASK_AVAILABILITY, ASK_DELIVERY, ASK_SPECS, GREETING, HUMAN_AGENT_REQUEST, THANKS, UNKNOWN\n\nAlso extract:\n- model: battery model/part number mentioned by the customer. Return null if not mentioned.\n- quantity: number of batteries requested/ordered. Return null if not mentioned.\n\nCustomer reply: {{ $json.raw_text }}\n\nRespond ONLY with valid JSON, no other text, no markdown fences:\n\n{\n  \"intent\": \"ONE_OF_THE_11_INTENTS_ABOVE\",\n  \"model\": \"MODEL_OR_PART_NUMBER_OR_NULL\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        512,
        272
      ],
      "id": "3e7b2e94-3d80-4421-b007-e0d1eabdf31c",
      "name": "Classify Intent",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $('Input Customer Message').first().json;\nconst fallback = {\n  intent: 'ASK_AVAILABILITY',\n  model: null,\n  quantity: null,\n  conversation_id: input.conversation_id,\n  message_id: input.message_id,\n  raw_text: input.raw_text,\n  image_url: input.image_url ?? null\n};\nconst raw = $input.first().json.text || $input.first().json.output;\nif (!raw) {\n  return [{ json: fallback }];\n}\ntry {\n  const cleaned = String(raw).replace(/```json/g, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\n  const parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      ...fallback,\n      intent: String(parsed.intent || 'ASK_AVAILABILITY').trim(),\n      model: parsed.model ?? null,\n      quantity: parsed.quantity ?? null\n    }\n  }];\n} catch {\n  return [{ json: fallback }];\n}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        864,
